# The XML is now a GENERATED artifact, not a source. It is produced from data/ by
# `npm run build:xml` (wired into prebuild) and published from dist/. Committing it
# would recreate the two-sources-of-truth problem this repository exists to remove.
# The historic export is preserved at tests/fixtures/SemDom-v4-original.xml, and
# immutable release copies live under releases/.
